# vvaharness/backends/harness/permissions.py

The deny-by-default permission gate for a read-only session. On the Claude route it is wired as the `can_use_tool` callback (see `claude/options.sudo`). Its only constructor call in the package is the validation write gate.

Source: `vvaharness/backends/harness/permissions.py` (lines 1-74)
Executor: code
Called from: `vvaharness/validation/session/setup.py:42-47` validation_write_gate (installed as `StreamingOptions.permissions` at `vvaharness/validation/session/launcher.py:323`); consumed by `claude/options.py` _permissions_callback

// src: vvaharness/backends/harness/permissions.py:37-44
PermissionsPolicy {
  target_dir: Path
  allowed_output_files: {}   // deny all writes by default; the validation caller opts in DEFAULT_ALLOWED_OUTPUT_FILES
  // preserved: source comment at permissions.py:40 — the SDK skips can_use_tool for tools listed bare in allowed_tools, so listing "Write" there voids evaluate_write
}

// src: vvaharness/backends/harness/permissions.py:58-71
fn PermissionsPolicy.evaluate(tool_name, input_data):executor=code {
  resolved = target_dir resolved to an absolute real path
  match (tool_name) {
    case "Write" => return permission_rules.evaluate_write(input_data, resolved, allowed_output_files)
    case "Bash" => return PermissionDecision(false, "Bash is disabled in validation sessions — no shell execution permitted", interrupt=true)
    default => return _evaluate_simple(tool_name)
  }
}

// src: vvaharness/backends/harness/permissions.py:46-56
fn PermissionsPolicy._evaluate_simple(tool_name):executor=code {
  require tool_name not in UNCONDITIONALLY_DENIED_TOOLS   // "Edit", "NotebookEdit"
    => return PermissionDecision(false, "read-only validation session: Edit/NotebookEdit blocked", interrupt=true)
  if (tool_name in READ_ONLY_TOOLS || tool_name starts with MCP_TOOL_PREFIX) return PermissionDecision(true)   // Read, Grep, Glob, Agent, Task, TodoWrite, Skill, any mcp__ tool
  return PermissionDecision(false, "tool not permitted in read-only validation session: $tool_name", interrupt=true)   // everything else is denied
}
